@token = cole-aqui-o-token-retornado-no-login
@contaId = 1
@contaDestinoId = 2

### 1. Cadastro de cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "João Silva",
    "cpf": "45566045839",
    "email": "joao.teste@email.com",
    "senha": "Senha123!"
}

### 2. Cadastro com CPF inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "João Silva",
    "cpf": "123",
    "email": "email-invalido",
    "senha": ""
}

### 4. Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "pedro.teste@email.com",
    "senha": "Senha123!"
}

### 5. Login inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "joao.teste@email.com",
    "senha": "SenhaErrada!"
}

### 6. Consultar cliente sem autenticação
GET http://localhost:8080/clientes/1

### 7. Consultar cliente autenticado
GET http://localhost:8080/clientes/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Depositar
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes/depositar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contaId": {{contaId}},
    "valor": 25.50
}

### 9. Sacar
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes/sacar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contaId": {{contaId}},
    "valor": 10.00
}

### 10. Transferir para outra conta
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes/transferir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contaOrigemId": {{contaId}},
    "contaDestinoId": {{contaDestinoId}},
    "valor": 5.00
}

### 11. Consultar extrato
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes/extrato?contaId={{contaId}}&dataInicio=2026-01-01T00:00:00&dataFim=2027-01-01T00:00:00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Consultar transações da conta
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes/conta/{{contaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}